## Final Thoughts

Making a kid's bedroom cozy doesn't mean spending thousands or doing a full renovation. Start with one or two of these ideas — a canopy, warmer lighting, or a reading nook — and build from there. The goal is a room that feels safe, warm, and completely theirs.

The best kids' rooms aren't the ones that look perfect in photos. They're the ones your child never wants to leave.

